## 3. Business Requirements → Tool Mapping

| Requirement | Tool Used | Why |
|---|---|---|
| Send confirmation email on application submission | **Flow** (after-save) | Declarative Email Alert action, no code needed |
| Auto-fill Application Date on creation | **Flow** (before-save / Fast Field Updates) | Single-record field assignment at save time |
| Prevent duplicate applications | **Apex Trigger** | Requires a SOQL query across existing Application records — not possible in a Validation Rule, and needs to be bulk-safe for imports |
| Reject application if Student CGPA < Job's minimum CGPA | **Validation Rule** | Single-record, same-transaction comparison via cross-object formula fields |
| Create Offer Letter record when Status becomes "Selected" | **Apex Trigger** | Related-record creation kept alongside the duplicate-check logic to keep automation ordering predictable and bulk-safe |

