## 5. Validation Rules

**5.1 — Student CGPA must be ≥ the Job's minimum CGPA**
```
AND(
  NOT(ISBLANK(Student__c)),
  NOT(ISBLANK(Job__c)),
  Student__r.Cgpa__c < Job__r.Min_cgpa__c
)
```

**5.2 — Application Date cannot be after the Job's Closing Date**
```
AND(
  NOT(ISBLANK(Application_Date__c)),
  NOT(ISBLANK(Job__r.Closing_Date__c)),
  Application_Date__c > Job__r.Closing_Date__c
)
```

**5.3 — Mandatory fields cannot be left blank**
```
OR(
  ISBLANK(Student__c),
  ISBLANK(Job__c),
  ISBLANK(Application_Date__c)
)
```

